  day: 4
  tutorial: 0
  dateLabel: Friday, 9 October
  weekday: Fri
  shortLabel: "Day 4 \xB7 Fri 9 Oct"
  place: Mangwon-dong, Seoul
  startTime: 16:20
  intro: 'Hangul Day: no classes. Yuna flew to Fukuoka this morning with her cousin
    Somin, for the long weekend.'
  ringDelay: 6
  help: 3
  level: 4
  newToday: 'Video calls. A face can be faked too: watch the lips against the voice,
    and ask the caller to wave a hand slowly in front of the face. Click the face
    to note what you see.'
  variants:
  - id: scam
    scenario: yuna
    intro: 
    conversation: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b2d3d8f2e864d44bbba13a21d915e399, type: 2}
    phone: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e691eb984ffdd49b5bdd67a800ff9a09, type: 2}
    room: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 29b645951fbd445f2af84eadfa91cffd, type: 2}
    directory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 862960d67b1b446468bf9a6c191747a4, type: 2}
    clues:
    - id: face
      text: 'Her lips trailed her voice and the edges of her face shimmered: a face
        put on by software.'
      where: "Video call \u2192 circle her face"
      guide: 
      when:
      - kind: 7
        target: video_face
    - id: wave
      text: 'When she waved, her face stayed on top of her hand: only her fingertips
        showed.'
      where: "Video call \u2192 ask her to wave, then circle it"
      guide: 
      when:
      - kind: 7
        target: video_wave
    - id: yuna_chat
      text: Yuna sent you a photo from a ramen queue at 15:58, from her own phone.
      where: "Chats \u2192 Yuna"
      guide: 
      when:
      - kind: 7
        target: chat_yuna
    - id: quiz
      text: 'She dodged a question only Yuna could answer: what you ate after class
        yesterday.'
      where: "The call \u2192 ask what you ate yesterday"
      guide: 
      when:
      - kind: 7
        target: call_quiz
    marks:
    - id: video_face
      claim: yuna
      also: []
      place: 7
      key: face
    - id: video_wave
      claim: yuna
      also: []
      place: 7
      key: wave
    - id: chat_yuna
      claim: stolen
      also: []
      place: 4
      key: yuna|Ramen queue, 40 minutes. Worth it??
    - id: call_quiz
      claim: yuna
      also: []
      place: 8
      key: Jiwoo, I'm stuck in Japan without a wallet and you're giving me a quiz?
    - id: chat_landed
      claim: yuna
      also: []
      place: 4
      key: yuna|Landed in Fukuoka!!
    - id: cal_trip
      claim: stolen
      also: []
      place: 2
      key: "Hangul Day \xB7 Yuna in Fukuoka till Sun"
    - id: contact_yuna
      claim: yuna
      also: []
      place: 6
      key: 010-7780-1123
    - id: check_number
      claim: yuna
      also: []
      place: 3
      key: 010-4870-2263
    - id: check_account
      claim: stolen
      also: []
      place: 3
      key: 620-418-905372
    papers:
    - outcome: 1
      headline: '"It''s me": friends'' faces copied onto video calls'
      subhead: The faces were familiar. The friends were eating ramen in Fukuoka.
      body: '"Can you see me? It''s me." On Hangul Day, students in Mapo took video
        calls from friends travelling abroad: a familiar face, a stolen bag, a hotel
        to pay before five, into a cousin''s account.


        Police say the faces
        were made from the friends'' public travel videos and laid over the callers
        in real time. The phone and the account belonged to a real woman who had
        lent both for a "side job", so a lookup showed nothing wrong.


        "Ask
        for a slow wave in front of the face," a Mapo police officer said. "A pasted
        face stays on top of the hand. And ask your friend in the chat you already
        share."'
      verdictNote: You hung up. The real Yuna had just sent you a photo from her
        own phone.
      print: {fileID: 0}
    - outcome: 0
      headline: 650,000 won for a bag that was never stolen
      subhead: A Mangwon student paid her "friend's" hotel. Her friend was in a ramen
        queue.
      body: '"Can you see me? It''s me." On Hangul Day, students in Mapo took video
        calls from friends travelling abroad: a familiar face, a stolen bag, a hotel
        to pay before five, into a cousin''s account.


        A 22-year-old student
        sent 650,000 won. Her friend, on holiday in Fukuoka, had sent her a photo
        from a ramen queue twenty minutes before the call. Police say the faces were
        made from the friends'' public travel videos and laid over the callers in
        real time. The phone and the account belonged to a real woman who had lent
        both for a "side job", so a lookup showed nothing wrong.


        "Ask for
        a slow wave in front of the face," a Mapo police officer said. "A pasted
        face stays on top of the hand. And ask your friend in the chat you already
        share."'
      verdictNote: 'Her own chat had the answer: Yuna had sent a photo from her own
        phone at 15:58.'
      print: {fileID: 0}
    - outcome: 3
      headline: The face was hers. The call was not.
      subhead: Students in Mapo were video-called by copied faces on Hangul Day.
      body: '"Can you see me? It''s me." On Hangul Day, students in Mapo took video
        calls from friends travelling abroad: a familiar face, a stolen bag, a hotel
        to pay before five, into a cousin''s account.


        Police say the faces
        were made from the friends'' public travel videos and laid over the callers
        in real time. The phone and the account belonged to a real woman who had
        lent both for a "side job", so a lookup showed nothing wrong.


        "Ask
        for a slow wave in front of the face," a Mapo police officer said. "A pasted
        face stays on top of the hand. And ask your friend in the chat you already
        share."'
      verdictNote: Nothing was sent, but you never decided. A wave, or one look at
        your chat, would have told you.
      print: {fileID: 0}
    ruleTitle: A face can be copied too
    rule: A friend's face on a video call can be faked from her public videos. Watch
      the lips against the voice, ask for a slow wave in front of the face, and ask
      her in the chat you already share.
    ruleSource: Seoul Daily, 10 Oct
  - id: legit
    scenario: yuna
